        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml UltraCacheArchitecture\n\ntitle UltraCache System Overview\n\npackage \&quot;UltraCache System\&quot; {\n  \n  [UltraCache Runtime] as Runtime\n  [Strategy Engine] as Strategy\n  [Ambrosia Event Sync] as EventSync\n  [Policy Registry] as Registry\n  [Metrics Reporter] as Metrics\n  [Management Console] as Console\n\n  Runtime --&gt; Strategy : Executes policy chain\n  Runtime --&gt; Registry : Loads policy config\n  Runtime --&gt; Metrics : Reports usage/latency\n  Runtime --&gt; EventSync : Subscribes to domain events\n\n  EventSync --&gt; Runtime : Invalidate / refresh cache\n  Strategy --&gt; Registry : Get policy definition\n  Console --&gt; Registry : Manage strategy/version\n  Console --&gt; Metrics : Visualize performance\n\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Service Request\&quot; as Request\nactor \&quot;Fallback Source\&quot; as Fallback\nactor \&quot;Event Bus\&quot; as EventBus\n\nRequest --&gt; Runtime : Invoke service method\nRuntime --&gt; Fallback : Trigger fallback on miss\nEventBus --&gt; EventSync : Emit domain events\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="nV1Q5nS43fcXgStbNoqW-1">
